  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Suspect_Diva
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "Je pense que Holly Marie, la chanteuse, est notre meurtri\xE8re."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Ne l'avions-nous pas \xE9limin\xE9e de nos suspects il y a quelques heures
      ? Sans compter que la majorit\xE9 de nos preuves nous l\u2019a prouv\xE9."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Je suis assez d\xE9\xE7u je t\u2019avoue, ce n\u2019est pas l\u2019heure
      des fausses accusations. Ne me fais pas de faux espoirs la prochaine fois."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21b87153fb3e5f94c809d9a129d0e1ee, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "J\u2019ai d\xFB me tromper, d\xE9sol\xE9. Je suis un peu rouill\xE9."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: Eh bien respire un bon coup, fais une pause et revois tes notes. Je sais
      que tu peux y arriver.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
